}]}],"dedicated":null,"used_in":[],"lore":"Fifteen years ago, Rahkun's tribe was driven deep into Silent Mine by Teo.\nTeo promised that he would come back to wipe out the rest of the orcs if they set foot outside of the mine, so these orcs lived in fear for the next fifteen years.\nBut the orcs who experienced Teo's ferocity began to grow old and die, and the newer generation of orcs grew increasingly angry at the fact that they were confined to their mine. Their voices won out and the orcs began to consider venturing out from the mine once again.\nRahkun was one of these orcs. He led his tribe to conquer the spiders and the bats and left the mine to march on into the outside world.\nHowever, his brief stint into the open air did not last long, as the only thing waiting for him outside were the spears of Eileene's Daybreak Mercenaries."}